  {
    "change": "Change 6: the generic \"How students from India save in Boston\" tips are gone; deals come only from approved official sources.",
    "from": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<h3 class=\"d\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 30px\">General tips</h3>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 18px\"><article class=\"tile\" style=\"background: #C9CBFA; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px 24px 26px; min-height: 236px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><span style=\"align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px 6px 9px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)\"><span style=\"width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C9CBFA\"></span>Housing</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 6px\">Live further out on the T</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4B63\">Rent usually drops away from the campus core. Many students share in Allston, Brighton or Somerville and take the train in.</span></article><article class=\"tile\" style=\"background: #C9CBFA; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px 24px 26px; min-height: 236px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><span style=\"align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px 6px 9px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)\"><span style=\"width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C9CBFA\"></span>Housing</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 6px\">Plan around 1 September</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4B63\">Most Boston leases start on 1 September. Students moving out often give away furniture that week, so wait before buying.</span></article><article class=\"tile\" style=\"background: #DDFF7A; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px 24px 26px; min-height: 236px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><span style=\"align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px 6px 9px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)\"><span style=\"width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DDFF7A\"></span>Living costs</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 6px\">Cook together, shop in bulk</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4B63\">Splitting rice, dal and spices with flatmates goes much further than eating out.</span></article><article class=\"tile\" style=\"background: #9FEADA; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px 24px 26px; min-height: 236px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\"><span style=\"align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px 6px 9px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)\"><span style=\"width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #9FEADA\"></span>Moving money</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 6px\">Send fewer, larger transfers</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4B63\">Each transfer has fees, and banks often add a markup to the rate. Compare against the mid-market rate before you send.</span></article></div>\n</div>\n",
    "to": ""
  },
