    "from": "<article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Gyms\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 26px 26px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #DDFF7A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9V15M7 7V17M17 7V17M20 9V15M7 12H17\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></span>Gyms</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">15% off</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Orangetheory Fitness, Fenway</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">Off current membership rates for students.</span>\n<a href=\"https://www.boston.com/community/neighborhoods/2026/09/14/where-to-find-college-student-discounts-in-boston-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: Boston.com, Sep 2026</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Getting around\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 26px 26px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #9FEADA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"16\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"16\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 16L10.5 9H15L17 16M9.5 7H12\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>Getting around</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">11% off</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">MBTA Semester Pass</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">Discounted T passes, bought through participating schools. Ask your student affairs or transport office.</span>\n<a href=\"https://mbta.getanchor.io/fares/college-student-semester-passes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: MBTA pass programme</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Getting around\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 26px 26px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #9FEADA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"16\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"16\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 16L10.5 9H15L17 16M9.5 7H12\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>Getting around</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">Cheaper bikes</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Bluebikes, through your school</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">Many schools, including BU and Tufts, offer discounted Bluebikes memberships. The price depends on your school.</span>\n<a href=\"https://www.bu.edu/transportation/bicycling/bluebikes-discount/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: BU Transportation</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Museums\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 26px 26px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #C9CBFA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9L12 4L20 9M6 10V17M10 10V17M14 10V17M18 10V17M4 20H20\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>Museums</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">Free entry</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Museum of Fine Arts</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">Free admission with student ID if your school is in the MFA University Membership Program.</span>\n<a href=\"https://mfa.org/programs/college-programs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: mfa.org</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Museums\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 26px 26px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #C9CBFA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9L12 4L20 9M6 10V17M10 10V17M14 10V17M18 10V17M4 20H20\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>Museums</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">Free entry</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">Free admission with valid ID for students at University Membership schools.</span>\n<a href=\"https://www.boston.com/community/neighborhoods/2026/09/14/where-to-find-college-student-discounts-in-boston-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: Boston.com, Sep 2026</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Music & theatre\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 26px 26px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #F7B9EE; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 17V6L19 4V15\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"15\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></span>Music & theatre</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">$35 pass</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Boston Symphony Orchestra</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">The Student Pass gets college students into many BSO concerts, one ticket per series, booked week by week.</span>\n<a href=\"https://bso.org/special-ticket-opportunities/bso-college-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: bso.org</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Sport\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 26px 26px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #F7B9EE; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6C9 9 9 15 7 18M17 6C15 9 15 15 17 18\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></span>Sport</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">From $9</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Red Sox Student9s</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">Student tickets for select home games and events at Fenway Park. Register for the programme first.</span>\n<a href=\"https://www.boston.com/community/neighborhoods/2026/09/14/where-to-find-college-student-discounts-in-boston-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: Boston.com, Sep 2026</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Food & coffee\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 26px 26px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #DDFF7A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 9H17V13A5 5 0 0 1 12 18H10A5 5 0 0 1 5 13Z\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M17 10H18.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 18.5 15H16.5M8 4V6M12 4V6\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></span>Food & coffee</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">Free coffee</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Cafe Landwer, Back Bay and Cleveland Circle</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">For students studying there: bring a laptop and student ID and order at the coffee bar.</span>\n<a href=\"https://www.boston.com/community/neighborhoods/2026/09/14/where-to-find-college-student-discounts-in-boston-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: Boston.com, Sep 2026</a>\n</article>",
